Backport of NVIDIA/open-gpu-kernel-modules PR #1505 (head 5c32c20222db,
by Samuel Williams) to the 615.78.08 tag:
  - nvkms: add optional delay between HDMI FRL training attempts
  - nvkms: retain last-assessed FRL link caps when assessment fails
  - nvkms, nvidia-drm: retrain an active FRL link lost by the sink
Adjusted for 615.78.08: no hdmi.scdcSrcTestConfig field and no
content_protection_event_work in nvidia-drm. All behavior is opt-in via
nvidia-modeset frl_train_backoff_ms / frl_caps_retention (default off).
https://github.com/NVIDIA/open-gpu-kernel-modules/pull/1505

